      "type": "event",
      "date": "2026-01-19T11:10:00.000Z",
      "title": "Share Samadhan Limited Appoints Cs Pragya Bhansali as Company Secretary and Compliance Officer, Effective January 19, 2026",
      "body": "Share Samadhan Limited appointed CS Pragya Bhansali as the Company Secretary and Compliance Officer of the Company with effect from January 19, 2026 in the board meeting dated January 19, 2026. CS Pragya Bhansali is a Company Secretary (CS Professional) with experience in corporate governance, regulatory compliance, and capital market transactions. She has been closely associated with the successful listing of Share Samadhan Limited on the SME platform of BSE, where she contributed to pre-listing funding initiatives, corporate restructuring exercises, and coordination with merchant bankers, stock exchange officials, and other intermediaries. She possesses sound knowledge of compliances under the Companies Act, 2013, SEBI (LODR) Regulations, and SEBI (ICDR) Regulations, and has experience i",
      "keyDevTypeId": "16",
      "source_url": null,
      "raw_subtype": "EventActivity"
    },
